AR - Agricultural Residential and subdivision permit and plat for Mesa
Tracts, 5th Filing, located at Tract 11, Mesa Tracts, Laramie County,
WY.
24 - 356
Mesa Tracts, 5th Filing, Zone Change and Subdivision
Permit and Plat
Attachments:
Justin Arnold, Planning, said Steil Surveying Services, LLC, on behalf of The Ramona
Niland Trust, submitted a subdivision permit and plat application for Mesa Tracts, 5th
Filing. He said the intent is to subdivide one sixteen-and-a-half (16.55) acre tract into
three tracts of approximately five-and-a-half (5.45) acres each. Arnold said the
property is located at 8420 E Pershing Blvd, approximately 1/4 of a mile east of
Christensen Rd, and the land is within the A2 - Agricultural zone district. He said that
since the new density would violate the requirements of the A2 zone district, the
applicant also asked to rezone the property to AR - Agricultural Residential.
Arnold said based on evidence provided, staff recommends approval of the zone
change and the subdivision permit and plat with the adoption of findings of fact a, b
