28. Discussion on fire restrictions for Laramie County.
24 - 351
Matt Butler, Fire Warden, gave an overview of his communication with the fire district
chiefs. He noted only Fire District #10 is requesting fire restrictions.
A motion was made by Vice Chairman Malm, seconded by Commissioner
Thompson, to adopt stage one fire restrictions for the area within Laramie
County Fire District #10.
Lovett, Malm, Heath, Holmes, Thompson
Aye:
Butler gave a list of firework safety precautions to help prevent fires.
The meeting adjourned at 4:37 pm.
